      "description": "A close-up portrait of a person with developmental disability, looking directly at the camera with a neutral to slightly smiling expression. The image is overlaid with the text 'i'm cute' positioned at the top center, creating a direct visual and conceptual juxtaposition between the subject and the infantilizing phrase.",
